{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45671","headline":"上卢少卿觅千文 · 贯休","name":"上卢少卿觅千文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荆山有美玉，含华尚炳烂。\n堪爲圣君玺，堪爲圣君案。\n草木润不雕，烟霞覆不散。\n野人到山下，仰视星辰畔。\n倘或如栗黄，保之上霄汉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}